// AWS GuardDuty Disabled or Tampered  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1562.008
// Detects actions that disable or weaken GuardDuty (DeleteDetector, StopMonitoringMembers, DeleteMembers, DisassociateFromMasterAccount,…
// False positives: Planned GuardDuty administration in multi-account setups.
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/guardduty-disable.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^DeleteDetector$/i or eventName=/^StopMonitoringMembers$/i or eventName=/^DeleteMembers$/i or eventName=/^DisassociateFromMasterAccount$/i or eventName=/^UpdateDetector$/i eventSource=/^guardduty\.amazonaws\.com$/i
